#* {{quote-journal|en|author=Patrick Healy|title=Spitzer and Clinton Win in N.Y. Primary|work=The New York Times|date=2006-09-13|url=https://www.nytimes.com/2006/09/13/nyregion/13york.html|issn=0362-4331|passage=Mr. Spitzer’s defeat of his Democratic opponent {{...|, Thomas R. Suozzi, the Nassau County executive,}} ended a primary season in which Hillary Rodham Clinton '''swamped''' an antiwar challenger for renomination to the Senate.|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20231215213927/https://www.nytimes.com/2006/09/13/nyregion/13york.html|archivedate=15 December 2023}}
